window)†www.instagram.com cite70†(opens in a new window)†www.tiktok.com cite71†(opens in a new window)†discord.gg L171: \nL172: OpenAI © 2015–2026 Your privacy choices\nL173: \nL174: English United States\nL175: \nL176: [Input: Search]\nL177: > \"Stripe is building the economic infrastructure for AI. That means re-architecting today’s commerce systems and creating new AI-powered experiences for billions of people. We’re proud to power Instant Checkout in ChatGPT and co-develop the Agentic Commerce Protocol to help businesses and AI platforms build the future of commerce.\"\nL178: \nL179: – Will Gaybrick, President, Technology and Business, Stripe\n"